| **Inbox** | Uncategorized dump zone. Process later | **Save Inbox:** All new saves land here. Swipe to organize or archive | v1 |
| **Projects** | Hierarchical folders | **Collections** (already planned). Add support for nested sub-collections | v1 |
| **Priority Levels (P1-P4)** | Color-coded urgency | **Urgency Flags:** 🔴 Must See, 🟡 Soon, 🔵 Whenever (maps to extension's urgency system) | v1 |
| **Labels/Tags** | Cross-project categorization | **Tags** (already planned) with auto-suggest based on content type | v1 |
| **Due Dates + Reminders** | Schedule when to do something | **Save Timer:** "Remind me in 2h / Tomorrow / This Weekend." Push notification links back to the save | v1 |
| **Recurring Tasks** | "Every Monday" | **Weekly Review Prompt:** "You have 12 unreviewed saves from this week" — Sunday evening nudge | v2 |
| **Filters & Custom Views** | "Show me all P1 tasks due this week" | **Smart Filters:** Filter by platform + tag + urgency + date range. Save custom filter as a "Smart Collection" | v2 |
| **Sections** | Group items within a project | **Collection Sections:** Within a collection, group items by status (To Watch / In Progress / Done) | v2 |
| **Karma / Productivity Score** | Gamification — points for completing tasks | **Save Streak + Review Score:** Track saves processed vs accumulated. Weekly score | v2 |
| **Comments on Tasks** | Add notes to a task | **Notes on Saves:** Already planned — quick text or voice note per save | v1 |
| **Subtasks** | Break a task into steps | Not applicable for saves — skip | — |
| **Completed View** | See what you've done | **Archive:** View all items marked as "Done" / "Watched" with satisfaction stats | v1 |

